      "claim_type": "implementation",
      "authority_effect": "none",
      "statement": "engines.node moves from >=20.0.0 to >=22.22.0, the lowest floor every installed engines.node range accepts (posthog-node ^20.20.0 || >=22.22.0 is the binding range; the requested >=22.0.0 is still excluded by 12 packages including posthog-node, jsdom and @vitejs/plugin-react). Both ci.yml setup-node steps now provision 22.22.0. scripts/check-engines.mjs (bun run engines:check, run in CI after install and in bun run validate) fails when any installed package's engines.node excludes the declared floor or any ci.yml setup-node step provisions a different version; it fails on the previous >=20.0.0 tree (53 packages plus both CI steps) and passes on this commit (507 ranges). semver ^7.8.5 becomes a direct devDependency already present in the tree; bun.lock only re-hoists existing semver versions. Owner review is not established.",
